        "original_id": "b8168ffe-b21a-5354-a066-c3ab6f4abd9f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle\n- Works: The Martian, Johnny English, Game of Thrones, Goal!\n- Companies: Buena Vista Pictures\n- Topics: film and television production\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny English is a 2003 British-American spy comedy film that parodies the James Bond secret agent genre and uses comedy similar to Rowan Atkinson's Mr. Bean character.\n- Mark Huffam is a film and television producer.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on The Martian, Johnny English, and the television series Game of Thrones.\n- Goal! was produced by Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle, and Mark Huffam.\n- Buena Vista Pictures distributed Goal!.",
